    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0320" n="34" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg34"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/154</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Gerard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-08T13:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 8, 1916, 1 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received June 9, 12.30 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3972. Your 3062, June 6, 2 p. m. Interview with Munich paper correct and made
                    very good impression here. This interview was <pb facs="0321" n="35"
                        xml:id="pg35"/> wanted by authorities who wish to keep peace with America
                    and contained nothing but the merest generalities. Interview with evening <hi
                        rendition="#italic">National Zeitung</hi> pure invention and already
                    publicly denied in prominent newspaper here. Paris <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Journal</hi> of June 4 contained New York dispatch copied from <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Daily Express</hi>, presumably English paper, stating
                    that Grew has stated to the Department,
                    “If the harvest is unfavorable there will be serious riots and the demand for
                    peace, which is growing at this moment, will become insistent.” Hope you will
                    authorize me to state that Department gave out no such statement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
